# Frontend environment (Vite). Copy to frontend/.env — never commit .env.
#
# The Real Map + satellite "Photo" work with NO keys (Esri World Imagery,
# NASA GIBS live imagery, OpenTopoMap). Add ONE of these only if you want
# a higher-resolution / commercial-grade satellite layer.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser, so use a public token
# restricted to your site's URL — never a secret key.

# Option A — Mapbox (https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/) — public "pk." token
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# Option B — MapTiler (https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/) — free tier available
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=
